{"id": "EUVD-2026-92134", "enisaUuid": "ffd384d2-3c29-3a12-9dbc-82563aa30672", "description": "The gist RubyGem before 6.1.0 contains an improper certificate validation vulnerability that allows on-path attackers to intercept HTTPS traffic because http_connection in lib/gist.rb sets VERIFY_NONE. Attackers can present any certificate to read or modify GitHub API traffic, stealing OAuth tokens and login credentials to read and modify the victim's gists.", "datePublished": "2026-10-04T22:31:47", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-05T20:28:43", "baseScore": 9.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/defunkt/gist/issues/373", "https://github.com/defunkt/gist", "https://github.com/defunkt/gist/blob/v6.0.0/lib/gist.rb#L466-L468", "https://github.com/defunkt/gist/commit/07ccc1a6d46e9d36f0e85d0b1c5d795890ae6bcf", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/gist-rubygem-before-6.1.0-disabled-tls-certificate-verification"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-105221", "GHSA-phqh-xp3p-h6mr"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "5201ddfe-bbb1-361e-8a3d-b7e0ca9b8316", "product": {"name": "gist", "vendor": {"name": "defunkt"}}, "product_version": "4.0.0 <6.1.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ee8c5c25-20b2-3334-8d91-f7276259699e", "vendor": {"name": "defunkt"}}], "isExploited": false}